                            <comment id="15976238" author="sboikov" created="Thu, 20 Apr 2017 07:30:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;When execute tx on changing topology we already send old value available on primary to all backups, so this old value can be used on backups to execute &apos;invoke&apos;. So I got rid of code in GridDhtTxPrepareFuture sending to backups computed value instead of entry processors.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
